WEBVTT

00:00:01.890 --> 00:00:04.210
I am Ai.

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:09.020
Ai Amamiku Hasebe.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:12.680
Hasebe Ai?

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:16.100
This is the world 15 years into the future...

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:17.830
from your perspective.

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:22.960
15 years into the future? This is our future?

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:29.710
At the silver sky, the endless sky

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:36.010
I gazed together with you, without a word

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:42.180
Touching your back, with trembling fingers

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:47.650
I quietly ponder, as your profile looks up

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:53.690
I want to assure your smile, and the future ahead of you

00:00:53.690 --> 00:01:00.030
Just standing and crying, I want to erase myself away

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:05.920
As I extend my hands, it is almost within my reach

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:11.960
This is no fantasy, possibilities are perhaps right by my side

00:01:11.960 --> 00:01:17.800
Changing every sorrow into strength

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:23.980
Let's throw all limitations into the end of time

00:01:24.310 --> 00:01:27.140
Just keeping you as my aspirations

00:01:27.140 --> 00:01:32.320
Even in the driving wind

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:39.240
I'll still be pushing on ahead

00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:44.910
Misekku kesta

00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:52.840
Fortune. Will you save it for me, dear?

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:04.810
Knock it off!

00:02:04.810 --> 00:02:08.950
What's so goddamned amusing about filling
kid's heads with nonsense and scaring them?!

00:02:08.950 --> 00:02:11.470
I am only telling you the truth!

00:02:11.750 --> 00:02:13.720
Haruka-chan is my student!

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:17.820
If she has gone missing,
I will find her!

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:19.990
Oh, for god's sake...

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:22.360
If she has vanished
due to a tunnel effect...

00:02:22.360 --> 00:02:25.230
there is no way to
go about finding her!

00:02:25.230 --> 00:02:27.800
Tunnels? Bubbles?
What are you talking about?

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:30.340
That makes no sense at all.

00:02:30.340 --> 00:02:34.140
That's why I keep telling you!
There's a good possibility...

00:02:34.140 --> 00:02:36.070
Haruka-chan encountered
a quantum phenomenon...

00:02:36.070 --> 00:02:38.550
And I'm telling you
that makes no sense, d'uh!

00:02:40.650 --> 00:02:42.340
Beat it, old lady.

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:46.990
What did you say?! I'm only 26!

00:02:46.990 --> 00:02:49.590
Oh, really? So your make-up is
the source of your bad looks?

00:02:49.590 --> 00:02:52.790
Haw! And are YOU proud of
having no waistline whatsoever?

00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:54.390
Hey! Now I'm really pissed off!

00:02:54.390 --> 00:02:55.860
Yukie-chan...

00:02:56.530 --> 00:03:00.130
Come to think of it, didn't Haruka
say that someone was after her?

00:03:00.130 --> 00:03:01.170
Huh?

00:03:01.170 --> 00:03:03.310
It wasn't me they wanted after all.

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:06.590
They were after Haruka all along.

00:03:07.510 --> 00:03:09.300
After her? Who?

00:03:10.640 --> 00:03:12.330
I don't know.

00:03:13.010 --> 00:03:14.700
I just don't know!

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:18.210
Yuu...

00:03:20.990 --> 00:03:22.590
Here.

00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:25.860
I don't expect you to
trust me right away...

00:03:25.860 --> 00:03:28.860
but if anything should come up,
contact me here.

00:03:28.860 --> 00:03:30.430
Goodbye.

00:03:30.430 --> 00:03:31.890
Hey, wait!

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:35.530
Kooriyama-san, let me search
around the area a little more.

00:03:35.530 --> 00:03:37.300
Sure thing.

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:39.900
What the hell is her problem?

00:03:41.340 --> 00:03:44.480
Investigation Department...
for the Cabinet?!

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:49.040
Wait up, Yuu!

00:03:49.310 --> 00:03:52.040
Wait up a minute!
Where are you gonna go?

00:03:52.950 --> 00:03:55.880
I have to find Haruka.

00:03:57.520 --> 00:03:59.050
Yuu...

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:32.950
Kuina...

00:04:34.060 --> 00:04:35.920
I will eliminate Karasu.

00:04:37.260 --> 00:04:41.000
To take no action against him
is a disgrace to the Dragon Soldiers!

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:43.130
He must be dealt with immediately!

00:04:44.640 --> 00:04:47.580
You're always thinking about Karasu.

00:04:48.670 --> 00:04:50.360
Meaning what exactly?

00:04:51.580 --> 00:04:55.410
Oh, never mind.
Is Fukuro here yet?

00:04:55.780 --> 00:04:58.680
Yeah, I'm sure he's
with his old friend.

00:05:01.550 --> 00:05:04.420
Haruka certainly is a strange one.

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:07.960
Lily, don't try to go to the
surface anymore now, all right?

00:05:07.960 --> 00:05:11.600
Aw! Fukuro, please don't
tell my mom about this!

00:05:11.600 --> 00:05:14.860
Sure thing. We wouldn't want
to make her worry too much.

00:05:15.070 --> 00:05:16.760
Thanks, Fukuro!

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:19.750
Oh, it's Mom!

00:05:23.810 --> 00:05:28.150
Hey, Fukuro? You've known Mom
for a long time, right?

00:05:28.150 --> 00:05:31.210
Yeah, ever since we
were about your size.

00:05:31.210 --> 00:05:34.350
I heard once that when she was young...

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:38.220
you guys also had
a friend named Haruka.

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:41.890
And now I've got a friend
with the same name, huh!

00:05:46.130 --> 00:05:48.740
Is this really our future?

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:52.070
Why isn't there anything
on the surface?

00:05:52.070 --> 00:05:54.330
Why did the world end up like this?

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:56.970
Come on, please tell me, Ai!

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:03.920
Five years after where you came from...

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:05.980
there was a worldwide revolution.

00:06:06.690 --> 00:06:09.320
It all started from our town.

00:06:09.860 --> 00:06:11.550
Our town?

00:06:11.960 --> 00:06:14.790
You're still too young
to comprehend it.

00:06:14.790 --> 00:06:17.530
You don't understand the significance
of the state of de-coherence...

00:06:17.530 --> 00:06:20.630
occurring in the ordinary world
which was thought to be possible

00:06:20.630 --> 00:06:21.730
only in the quantum world.

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:26.370
De-coherence?
I don't understand difficult words.

00:06:26.710 --> 00:06:29.340
Where's Yuu? Miho? Isami?

00:06:29.340 --> 00:06:31.530
They're all here
in this world, aren't they?

00:06:32.210 --> 00:06:35.150
Even if they are alive,
they have nothing to do with you...

00:06:35.150 --> 00:06:37.250
or your world.

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:39.750
But why? It's our future, isn't it?

00:06:40.320 --> 00:06:43.210
This is only one of countless futures.

00:06:43.820 --> 00:06:47.320
To you, this is one possible future.

00:06:48.530 --> 00:06:52.250
To us, you are one
possibility from the past.

00:06:53.630 --> 00:06:56.060
So, it is the future
but it isn't the future?

00:06:56.570 --> 00:06:59.700
That's right. You do exist...

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:02.670
but to us it is quite possible
that you do not.

00:07:05.140 --> 00:07:06.610
But that's weird!

00:07:06.910 --> 00:07:10.550
I'm right here!
And you're right here, too!

00:07:11.550 --> 00:07:14.990
Perhaps you're still
too young to comprehend it...

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:17.180
but that is the truth of the universe.

00:07:19.060 --> 00:07:22.160
The future, the past,
and even the present...

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:24.560
are only existences within chaos.

00:07:25.260 --> 00:07:27.450
I don't understand it that well...

00:07:27.770 --> 00:07:30.700
but both you and I are right here.

00:07:39.440 --> 00:07:41.010
Haruka...

00:07:42.180 --> 00:07:45.020
It's all right. If it will save you...

00:07:49.450 --> 00:07:51.100
Karasu...

00:07:51.620 --> 00:07:55.450
I know that you tried to protect
the Dragon Torque from Atori.

00:07:56.700 --> 00:08:00.850
Atori attempted to obliterate
the Dragon Torque from the dimension.

00:08:02.400 --> 00:08:05.570
That was the source of
the Gestalt collapse, correct?

00:08:06.870 --> 00:08:08.840
I will protect Haruka.

00:08:10.110 --> 00:08:11.940
Haruka is dead.

00:08:12.410 --> 00:08:15.180
That Haruka is from a different
dimension from the one we exist...

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:17.040
It is our past.

00:08:19.650 --> 00:08:20.950
You're wrong!

00:08:20.950 --> 00:08:24.640
No matter how much it resembles the
world of your past, it is an illusion!

00:08:25.360 --> 00:08:27.260
It is an illusionary
world that exists...

00:08:27.260 --> 00:08:29.570
only because we transported to it!

00:08:49.180 --> 00:08:52.020
I bet that those two are
with the secret intelligence.

00:08:52.020 --> 00:08:54.220
That Majestic 12 thing!

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:55.390
What's that?

00:08:55.390 --> 00:08:58.190
They're an organization that investigates
alien life. Don't you know about it?

00:08:58.190 --> 00:08:59.350
Why would I?

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:02.730
Ooh! Aliens have finally
come to invade Earth!

00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:04.160
I doubt it.

00:09:04.160 --> 00:09:06.000
What are you talking about, Fujiwara-kun?

00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:09.170
Aliens remove the internal
organs from cows, you know!

00:09:09.170 --> 00:09:12.360
Hey, that's it! Haruka
was abducted by space aliens!

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:14.570
Shut up, Miho!
Stop joking around about this!

00:09:14.870 --> 00:09:18.910
But why? I'm seriously worried
about her too, you know!

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:21.250
Yukie-chan, what should we do?

00:09:21.250 --> 00:09:22.980
We can't get through
on her cell phone, right?

00:09:22.980 --> 00:09:25.320
Yeah. It's on answering mode.

00:09:25.320 --> 00:09:27.580
She forgets her phone a lot.

00:09:28.650 --> 00:09:30.260
It's already 7 o'clock.

00:09:30.260 --> 00:09:33.120
- I'm worried, worried, worried!
- That's impossible.

00:09:40.370 --> 00:09:43.400
Where are you, Haruka?

00:09:48.040 --> 00:09:51.330
I wonder what I do in this world?

00:09:54.550 --> 00:09:56.080
No...

00:09:56.080 --> 00:09:57.770
I can't do it.

00:10:02.050 --> 00:10:06.040
The Dragon Torque must not
fall into the hands of La'cryma.

00:10:06.520 --> 00:10:08.060
But...

00:10:08.860 --> 00:10:12.220
You want Shangri-la, don't you?

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:14.870
That's right.

00:10:14.870 --> 00:10:17.300
I want to escape from the ring of destiny.

00:10:18.140 --> 00:10:21.310
Your destiny is cursed.

00:10:21.310 --> 00:10:23.700
Both your past and your future...

00:10:24.780 --> 00:10:27.380
That is precisely why
you may achieve salvation.

00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:30.050
If you come to Shangri-la...

00:10:42.860 --> 00:10:44.790
Shangri-la!

00:10:59.480 --> 00:11:02.080
It's unusual for you to
come to the dragon's lair.

00:11:03.210 --> 00:11:05.220
Lily looked like she was doing well.

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:08.110
Yeah. She's as cheeky as ever.

00:11:09.090 --> 00:11:11.980
She takes after her mother.
They're identical.

00:11:14.430 --> 00:11:16.420
I'm starting to have doubts.

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:23.270
The girl is too similar
to the Haruka we know.

00:11:23.800 --> 00:11:26.770
Of course she is.
It's an approximate world.

00:11:28.810 --> 00:11:31.780
Will we end up turning
our backs on her again?

00:11:36.350 --> 00:11:38.280
Don't think about it, Amamiku.

00:11:38.280 --> 00:11:40.920
Thinking about it will
plunge you into deeper chaos.

00:11:48.490 --> 00:11:50.060
It's Shangri-la!

00:12:00.410 --> 00:12:02.240
<i>Uroboros formation confirmed.</i>

00:12:03.170 --> 00:12:05.870
<i>Limes breach. Shangri-la corrosion.</i>

00:12:07.880 --> 00:12:09.790
Why now?

00:12:10.720 --> 00:12:14.620
The Dragon Torque will soon lead us...

00:12:14.620 --> 00:12:17.010
To a perfect defense shield.

00:12:17.360 --> 00:12:20.650
With that, we will finally...

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:24.520
It will be fine as long
as no errors occur...

00:12:25.230 --> 00:12:26.920
I hope.

00:12:39.380 --> 00:12:43.780
Ventora, ventora!
Space people, please answer!

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:46.530
- Ventora, ventora...
- Mukai, can we stop now?

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:50.420
No! We have to get them to
return Haruka! Chant seriously!

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:52.860
We don't know for sure it was aliens.

00:12:52.860 --> 00:12:54.930
Ventora, ventora...

00:12:54.930 --> 00:12:57.490
Space people, please answer!

00:13:00.030 --> 00:13:02.510
Yukie-chan is taking
this seriously. Impossible...

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:27.270
Haruka, where are you?

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:30.430
Is that boy all right?

00:13:30.430 --> 00:13:32.100
He looks really sick.

00:13:32.100 --> 00:13:33.790
Should I go get someone?

00:13:34.470 --> 00:13:37.930
Give her back!
Give Haruka back!

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:46.610
Haruka.

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:49.310
You don't have to worry about it.

00:13:49.310 --> 00:13:52.720
Goodbye. Thank you for everything.

00:13:52.720 --> 00:13:54.280
Karasu?

00:14:09.230 --> 00:14:11.980
Life reaction,
Reizu reaction all normal.

00:14:11.980 --> 00:14:14.480
Link with quantum computer stable.

00:14:15.310 --> 00:14:17.470
Your instructions, Amamiku-sama.

00:14:28.790 --> 00:14:29.790
Let it begin.

00:14:57.980 --> 00:14:59.670
Haruka...

00:15:05.260 --> 00:15:07.580
What? What is this thing?

00:15:12.330 --> 00:15:13.460
Water?

00:15:13.460 --> 00:15:15.000
Let me out! Let me...

00:15:42.860 --> 00:15:46.100
<i>Shangri-la raid-vessel
confirmed, coordinates set.</i>

00:15:46.100 --> 00:15:48.030
<i>Dragon knights mobilized.</i>

00:16:48.830 --> 00:16:52.190
The figures are stable.
Now moving on to the second stage.

00:17:00.410 --> 00:17:01.290
What?

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:07.280
Yuu...

00:17:07.280 --> 00:17:08.840
Haruka?!

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:11.940
Haruka?

00:17:13.330 --> 00:17:15.010
Haruka!

00:17:58.260 --> 00:17:59.950
It's landed!

00:18:05.800 --> 00:18:07.490
It's crying.

00:18:19.880 --> 00:18:21.270
Help m...

00:18:33.830 --> 00:18:36.830
Am I going to die?

00:18:37.670 --> 00:18:40.600
Will I ever see everyone again?

00:18:41.510 --> 00:18:43.170
Yuu...

00:18:43.170 --> 00:18:46.000
I wish I could've seen you once more.

00:18:53.420 --> 00:18:55.400
The Dragon Torque has appeared.

00:18:55.790 --> 00:18:57.260
Entropy rising!

00:18:57.260 --> 00:18:59.510
Beginning elementary
particlization reaction.

00:19:25.680 --> 00:19:27.250
Karasu.

00:20:07.730 --> 00:20:10.420
You came for me, Yuu.

00:20:20.910 --> 00:20:24.540
Why, Karasu?! Are you going
to let La'cryma become extinct?

00:20:25.640 --> 00:20:28.400
I will protect Haruka.

00:20:29.110 --> 00:20:31.370
I don't want to lose her again.

00:21:17.700 --> 00:21:19.330
I...

00:21:21.970 --> 00:21:25.970
Karasu. If you're going
to protect that girl...

00:21:25.970 --> 00:21:29.040
you may lose your very existence.

00:21:29.470 --> 00:21:31.440
That won't stop me.

00:21:31.440 --> 00:21:35.310
I will protect Haruka as long as I exist.

00:21:38.080 --> 00:21:39.930
Haruka?

00:21:43.220 --> 00:21:44.430
I'm sorry.

00:21:47.930 --> 00:21:49.450
Ai...

00:22:03.370 --> 00:22:06.300
<i>Dimension stabilizer restored,
limes reconstructed.</i>

00:22:14.820 --> 00:22:17.890
I won't let our world end yet.

00:22:24.960 --> 00:22:26.490
Hang on.

00:23:01.070 --> 00:23:02.600
Haruka!

00:23:26.590 --> 00:23:30.470
A sleepless night

00:23:30.470 --> 00:23:34.350
The sound of the second hand

00:23:34.350 --> 00:23:41.270
The rumble of the
refrigerator in the air

00:23:42.190 --> 00:23:46.070
Just as the moon
through the blinds...

00:23:46.070 --> 00:23:49.990
Waxes and wanes, someday..

00:23:49.990 --> 00:23:56.580
The pain will change to warmth

00:23:56.580 --> 00:24:01.790
Boat of time...

00:24:02.370 --> 00:24:07.050
No matter where it flows...

00:24:07.050 --> 00:24:13.180
Most likely we'll meet again

00:24:13.180 --> 00:24:16.800
From scars come the
footsteps of dawn

00:24:16.800 --> 00:24:20.020
Rather than sighing,
they secretly...

00:24:20.020 --> 00:24:26.110
come pouring down
on every new day

00:24:26.110 --> 00:24:30.650
No matter what sky it is

00:24:42.400 --> 00:24:45.140
I'm dreaming again.

00:24:45.140 --> 00:24:47.300
That summer day's dream.

00:24:50.590 --> 00:24:52.200
Haruka!

00:24:53.880 --> 00:24:57.430
Karasu, are you the Yuu from 15 years into the future?

00:25:00.540 --> 00:25:03.080
We will get rid of him ourselves!

00:25:04.360 --> 00:25:06.610
Next episode, Secrets.

00:25:07.990 --> 00:25:10.440
Will you keep it a secret?
